OL,3,GNEWSACargo plane 'bounced twice' during
OL,4,Alanding - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cargo plane suffered "substantial
OL,7,Fdamage" after bouncing twice before
OL,8,Fcoming to a stop on the runway at East
OL,9,FMidlands Airport.
OL,11,FThe Air Accidents Investigation Branch
OL,12,F(AAIB) said an aircraft from Guernsey
OL,13,Fin the Channel Islands landed on its
OL,14,Fnose wheel at the airport in Castle
OL,15,FDonington, Leicestershire, at 20:55 GMT
OL,16,Fon 14 November 2025.
OL,18,FThe report said the pilot reduced power
OL,19,Fbut the aircraft floated before
OL,20,Fpitching down sharply. The pilot and
OL,21,Fco-pilot were the only people on board
OL,22,Fand were not injured.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
